[19.246037, "o", "=== flicker ===\r\n"]
[19.247301, "o", "If configuration strings flicker across desk runs, keep_head in keeppit retains the first sys.conf payload the mill sees. That path is enough for a stable smoke against cluster.\r\n"]
[19.247581, "o", "=== usage ===\r\n"]
[19.248683, "o", "siltcord quarry [archive] [idx]\r\nsiltcord brief OUT.json [archive] [idx]\r\n"]
[19.248907, "o", "=== binary strings ===\r\n"]
